//	audClaimRefreshBackfillEnabled: Whether refresh grants without a resource
//	can adopt the requested resource when audience claims are enabled.
//	pkceRequired: Whether all new OAuth authorization-code requests must use
//	PKCE with the S256 challenge method.
//	clientIdMetadataDocumentsAdvertised: Whether the instance advertises support
//	for Client ID Metadata Documents in its OAuth authorization server metadata.
